consent.message:
By agreeing, you confirm that:
• you follow Anthropic's terms, and use the Claude Code you installed and signed in to yourself;
• Breezell may read and use what Claude Code reports about its connection, your account (email, organization, plan, sign-in method, version) and your usage limits;
• what you send in Breezell with a Claude Code model goes to your Claude Code, which works on it in that conversation's folder; when it asks before changing files or running commands, Breezell's auto-approve settings answer, or you do;
• Breezell may read the Claude Code conversations of the projects you open in it, and show them in those projects' conversation lists.
Breezell never reads, stores or passes on your Claude sign-in credentials.
